<p class="txt">
Due to performance and security concerns, the search is limited to 50 results.<br>

Here are some tips:<br><br>

1.- Narrow down the search by selecting the target country from the drop-down list.<br>
2.- Remove all accented or extended characters from your keywords.<br>
    The search engine will filter locations if you have misspelled them.<br>
3.- Use a "starts with" search<br>
4.- Use a "contains" search (much slower search, please don't abuse this)<br><br>

Q.- Can I propose a new location for your database?<br>
A.- Unfortunately not.<br>
</p>
